                  "text": "Nyu 18:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abilund jigo dwal mir anyong’a man dwal mi mutoro, ku dwand won ambadha man dwand mugole ku i adhura mi Yuda, man kud i gengi mi Yerusalem; kum ng’om bidoko ni uvuru.",
          "type": "text",
